menu "AXP2101 PMIC"
    config AXP2101_DISABLE_RAILS_ON_SLEEP
        bool "Switch off the PMIC output rails before deep sleep"
        default n
        help
            Saves power but, on some board revisions, switching off ALDO3 clamps
            the I2C bus so the RTC and PMIC become unreachable after wake-up.
            Enable only after checking on your board that wake-ups still work.
endmenu
